    {
      "pdf_sheet": 3,
      "book_pages": [
        3,
        4
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_01_pool_invitation.png",
      "art_sha256": "ec0b6690d17b4fa7f92a41e1b2e25248c9d93bacfe3bf07f9c9a007484af5a80",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "The castle's candle was still missing.\nBut Rumi's pool shimmered, and its rainbow kept turning."
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "\"Come and sing with my friends,\" said Rumi.\n\"My voice is very little,\" said Roshan.\nRumi held out her hand."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_sheet": 4,
      "book_pages": [
        5,
        6
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_02_city_beneath_pool_v2.png",
      "art_sha256": "59c0eb8ad79a83b655c79c119382b549bc2e884e05afa76f3709ab5145a28730",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "Down they swam, beneath the shining water.\nThey were still inside Pearl Castle.\nA whole city glowed below."
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "Curved roofs. Bright shops. A bubble tram!\nRoshan's tail flashed rainbow colours.\n\"All this was under our pool?\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_sheet": 5,
      "book_pages": [
        7,
        8
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_03_meet_hana_nari_v2.png",
      "art_sha256": "51ec6c931dfacfdfbe91bdb7d99a7033b121014a70e9c56df33d73dc1c15b698",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "Hana waved from the music room.\nHer copper hair floated like a ribbon.\nNari peeped around her shoulder."
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "\"I'm good at big dance moves,\" said Hana.\n\"I'm good at hearing tiny things,\" said Nari.\n\"I'm good at being here,\" said Roshan."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_sheet": 6,
      "book_pages": [
        9,
        10
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_04_first_song_no_answer.png",
      "art_sha256": "f812cd007d84bc9339232935d1a0f48574fa8d416cf1425a4af55bddcdc0721c",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "Rumi, Hana and Nari began.\n\"Little voice, big blue sea.\nSing with you, sing with me.\""
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 86,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 108,
          "text": "Usually, the city sang back.\nTonight, no answer came.\nBetween the notes, Roshan heard:\nTap. Tap. Tap."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_sheet": 7,
      "book_pages": [
        11,
        12
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_05_hear_turtle_v2.png",
      "art_sha256": "e2c3ef68a08f1b279b848ad79fd6ceb492e012d2798677ac2d3da91590cdab22",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 86,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 108,
          "text": "\"Wait,\" whispered Roshan.\n\"Someone is asking for help.\"\nShe followed the tapping beneath the tram bridge."
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 86,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 108,
          "text": "A little turtle was caught between two prop crates.\nA soft concert banner tangled round his shell.\n\"I'm Duri,\" he said. \"I'm stuck.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_sheet": 8,
      "book_pages": [
        13,
        14
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_06_rescue_duri.png",
      "art_sha256": "f365b3ca926237d77b2151228e6863552653aba6f2dad7604695c0bd34282641",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "\"We'll make you a space,\" said Roshan.\nRumi held the banner loose.\nRoshan pushed one crate away."
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 86,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 108,
          "text": "Hana steadied the other crate.\nNari counted, \"One, two, gently!\"\nDuri wriggled free.\n\"You heard me!\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_sheet": 9,
      "book_pages": [
        15,
        16
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_07_bathhouse_rest_song.png",
      "art_sha256": "f9b43a361113dfbacc28d9abbdbc6974f9cbc44365eb7eaa16c5b847373d05ae",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "They rested in the warm-current bathhouse.\nDuri stopped trembling.\nRoshan sang him a very little song."
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 86,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 108,
          "text": "\"Make a space and let it through.\nThere's a place for me and you.\"\nNari hummed beside her.\nDuri smiled."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_sheet": 10,
      "book_pages": [
        17,
        18
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_08_imp_clue.png",
      "art_sha256": "ddd012968d66d3b2bda7046557c2cf7a799f7a36c7870d30985aa8bae84172e9",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "Then a top hat bobbed past.\nA purple imp popped out of the bubbles.\n\"The stage is ours tonight!\" he squeaked."
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "Another imp dragged a glittery prop crate.\nDuri pointed after them.\n\"They piled those in our current channel.\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_sheet": 11,
      "book_pages": [
        19,
        20
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_09_current_gate_plan.png",
      "art_sha256": "a1d44024d522893b5211298dc40133c381b993ee7d2d2df7105a94cf859e9e13",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "Duri led them through a quiet passage.\nAt the concert terrace, ribbons barely stirred.\nCrates were jammed against the current gate."
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 86,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 108,
          "text": "\"The song can't reach our neighbours,\" said Rumi.\nHana raised her chin. Nari listened.\nRoshan looked at the gap beneath the crates."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_sheet": 12,
      "book_pages": [
        21,
        22
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_10_concert_fight_start.png",
      "art_sha256": "21e1dd98a6fd2ecf11a6df84b152ac92e4af131e7f56f1354d6cbcbdefc8d413",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "They swam up to the shell stage.\n\"Move your props, please,\" said Roshan.\nThe imps stuck out their tongues."
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 86,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 108,
          "text": "Rumi took the first note.\nHana swept into a bright dance.\nNari beat the rhythm.\nRoshan swam straight towards the gate."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_sheet": 13,
      "book_pages": [
        23,
        24
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_11_bubble_battle.png",
      "art_sha256": "bfb1ecef05a6b96809a9d188ea016024f70b1d8218284367bfd1fb467457a956",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "POOF! A cloud of bubbles!\nWHOOSH! A flying foam star!\nHana caught it on a soft banner."
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 86,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 108,
          "text": "Nari ducked. Rumi spun.\nRoshan swept a ribbon around the wobbling crate.\nThe imps bounced backwards onto cushions."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_sheet": 14,
      "book_pages": [
        25,
        26
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_12_roshan_opens_gate.png",
      "art_sha256": "3e303bec5c495daa43a5d77ec69fb7f65103b0545ee803955539f8bc4d057fa7",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 86,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 108,
          "text": "\"Now,\" said Roshan.\nRumi held the ribbon with her.\nHana pushed. Nari pulled.\nTogether, they moved the last crate."
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 86,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 108,
          "text": "Duri slipped through the open arch.\nThe current rushed after him.\nBlue light curled round the stage.\nThe magic had been there all along."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_sheet": 15,
      "book_pages": [
        27,
        28
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_13_city_encore_v2.png",
      "art_sha256": "89d7274ed0d33cdacc87886f29b1e61cfb8f62c405e166d5678d63d7907f2309",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 86,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 108,
          "text": "The shops answered first.\nThen the bathhouse. Then the tram.\nLittle voices travelled through the bright blue city."
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "Roshan sang with Rumi, Hana and Nari.\nShe did not sing the loudest.\nBut this time, she heard everyone."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_sheet": 16,
      "book_pages": [
        29,
        30
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_14_imps_make_space.png",
      "art_sha256": "83db10376f1dcd012994fa053e02e9f1914027c800c962ff3f3621be5b50294c",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 86,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 108,
          "text": "The imps peeked over their cushions.\n\"Is there a place for us?\"\n\"Yes,\" said Roshan. \"If you make space for others.\""
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 86,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 108,
          "text": "They carried the crates away.\nOne played a tiny bell. One took a bow.\nEven Duri joined in:\nTap. Tap. Tap."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "pdf_sheet": 17,
      "book_pages": [
        31,
        32
      ],
      "kind": "story_spread",
      "art": "native/spread_15_home_pool.png",
      "art_sha256": "1eab507ad93c6357982005ff4104d65b8e36e4216746e209852e6579a1d6cb64",
      "text_boxes": [
        {
          "x": 48,
          "y": 113,
          "width": 438,
          "height": 81,
          "text": "At last, Rumi and Roshan swam home.\nAbove them, the familiar rainbow turned.\nThe seahorse fountain splashed its welcome."
        },
        {
          "x": 526,
          "y": 86,
          "width": 426,
          "height": 108,
          "text": "\"We haven't found the candle yet,\" said Roshan.\n\"No,\" said Rumi. \"But today you heard a friend.\"\nAnd somewhere below, a little turtle tapped goodnight."
        }
      ]
    },
